{"id":"f7c401f974e8f1d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-bott-tau.md","title":"Bott–Taubes Configuration-Space Integral Core","display":"df-bott-tau — Bott–Taubes Configuration-Space Integral Core","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bott-tau","aliases":["58-df-bott-tau"],"display":"df-bott-tau — Bott–Taubes Configuration-Space Integral Core","depends_on":["[[58-df-configuration-space]]","[[58-df-lp-space]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bott-tau"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bott-tau</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bott-tau — Bott–Taubes Configuration-Space Integral Core"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a858639a199f0460\" href=\"?note=a858639a199f0460\" title=\"58-df-configuration-space\">58-df-configuration-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-bott-tau-—-Bott–Taubes-Integrals\">df-bott-tau — Bott–Taubes Integrals</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\\land C\\in V\\land\\Sigma\\in V\\land\\mu\\in V\\land h\\in V\\land I\\in V\\land k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(M\\in V\\land C\\in V\\land\\Sigma\\in V\\land\\mu\\in V\\land h\\in V\\land I\\in V\\land k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a858639a199f0460\" href=\"?note=a858639a199f0460\" title=\"58-df-configuration-space\">58-df-configuration-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land[h]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land[h]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bott\\text{-}tau} \\vdash \\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S(I,M,k,\\Sigma,\\mu,h)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,k)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(h;C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land I=\\int_C h\\,d\\mu\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bott\\text{-}tau} \\vdash \\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S(I,M,k,\\Sigma,\\mu,h)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,k)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(h;C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land I=\\int_C h\\,d\\mu\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是完整 Bott–Taubes 构造中“在配置空间上积分”的最小已闭合核心；积分域不再误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^1\">\\(S^1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>要进一步得到纽结不变量，还需在独立上游中形式化 Fulton–MacPherson 紧化、定向纤维积分、边界面消去与 weight-system/4T 条件；本原子不以无来源谓词冒充这些结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-bott-tau-—-Bott–Taubes-Integrals","text":"df-bott-tau — Bott–Taubes Integrals","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-configuration-space","status":"resolved","id":"a858639a199f0460","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-configuration-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lp-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-configuration-space","status":"resolved","id":"a858639a199f0460","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-configuration-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land[h]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)$ (see [[58-df-lp-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AeClass}$ 取 [[58-df-lp-space]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V\\land C\\in V\\land\\Sigma\\in V\\land\\mu\\in V\\land h\\in V\\land I\\in V\\land k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land[h]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bott\\text{-}tau} \\vdash \\mathrm{BottTaubesIntegral}_S(I,M,k,\\Sigma,\\mu,h)\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\exists C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ConfigurationSpace}_S(C,M,k)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land h\\in\\mathbb C^C\\land\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(h;C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\in L^1(C,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land I=\\int_C h\\,d\\mu\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"S^1","display":false}],"bytes":1641,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bott-tau.md|58-df-bott-tau]]（batch18）